 "reviewNotes": "V1.14 = V1.13 parts and poses re-sliced with the Bambu fix (filament_self_index one entry per variant row, --min-save: no model objects in the X1C archive; check_bambu_archive passes). Toolpaths match V1.13 except M73 progress lines and a few sub-0.002 mm extrusions on one White X1C layer. Orange: scripts/review_v111.py and review_brim.py (no brim, support reaches the front-plate ceiling, cover flap and both cap ears). White: scripts/review_v112.py (cap brim only 449.4 mm2, support interface 3 layers 0.15, support ironing on, 0 mm support at the 14 pilots). Orange Bambu: passed, 6505 s, 28.54 g; Orange Elegoo: passed, 6436 s, 27.66 g; White Bambu: passed, 14583 s, 87.82 g; White Elegoo: passed, 15206 s, 87.03 g"
